@startuml
left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "Colors Application" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Validate credentials" as Validate
  usecase "Search colors" as Search
  usecase "Add color" as Add
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}

User --> Login
Login ..> Validate : <<include>>
User --> Search
User --> Add
User --> Logout

note right of Search
  Search, Add, and Log out are available
  from color.html after a successful login.
  Logging out clears the client session
  and returns the user to index.html.
end note

@enduml
